{"parse":{"title":"120th United States Congress","pageid":82711526,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Senate_membership_changes\">Senate membership changes</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=120th_United_States_Congress&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Senate membership changes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=120th_United_States_Congress&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Senate membership changes\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1368532237\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:1.6em;margin-bottom:0.5em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote i{font-style:normal}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_special_elections_to_the_United_States_Senate\" title=\"List of special elections to the United States Senate\">List of special elections to the United States Senate</a></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<caption>Senate changes\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr style=\"vertical-align:bottom;\">\n<th scope=\"col\">State<br />(class)\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Vacated by\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" data-sort-type=\"date\">Reason for change\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Successor\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" data-sort-type=\"date\"><span class=\"nowrap\">Date of successor's</span><br /><span class=\"nowrap\">formal installation<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SuccessorInstallation&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SuccessorInstallation-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>a<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Minnesota\" title=\"List of United States senators from Minnesota\">Minnesota</a><br />(1)\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#95b0c9\"><span data-sort-value=\"Klobuchar, Amy\"><span class=\"vcard\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar\" title=\"Amy Klobuchar\">Amy Klobuchar</a></span></span></span><br />(DFL)\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"January 2027\">Incumbent resigning January 2027 after being <a href=\"/wiki/2026_Minnesota_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Minnesota gubernatorial election\">elected</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Governor_of_Minnesota\" title=\"Governor of Minnesota\">Governor of Minnesota</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KlobucharBlackburn&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KlobucharBlackburn-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><br />Successor will be appointed until a <a href=\"/wiki/2027_United_States_Senate_special_election_in_Minnesota\" title=\"2027 United States Senate special election in Minnesota\">special election</a> in November 2027.\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\">TBD\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Tennessee\" title=\"List of United States senators from Tennessee\">Tennessee</a><br />(1)\n</th>\n<td style=\"color:black; background-color:#FFB6B6\"><span data-sort-value=\"Blackburn, Marsha\"><span class=\"vcard\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"/wiki/Marsha_Blackburn\" title=\"Marsha Blackburn\">Marsha Blackburn</a></span></span></span><br />(R)\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"January 2027\">Incumbent resigning January 2027 after being <a href=\"/wiki/2026_Tennessee_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Tennessee gubernatorial election\">elected</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Governor_of_Tennessee\" title=\"Governor of Tennessee\">Governor of Tennessee</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KlobucharBlackburn&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KlobucharBlackburn-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><br />Successor will be appointed until a <a href=\"/wiki/2028_United_States_Senate_special_election_in_Tennessee\" title=\"2028 United States Senate special election in Tennessee\">special election</a> in November 2028.\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\">TBD\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br /><span class=\"error mw-ext-cite-error\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Cite error: There are <code>&lt;ref&#160;group&#61;lower-alpha&gt;</code> tags&#160;or <code>&#123;&#123;efn&#125;&#125;</code> templates on this page, but the references will not show without a <code>&#123;&#123;reflist&#124;group&#61;lower-alpha&#125;&#125;</code> template&#160;or <code>&#123;&#123;notelist&#125;&#125;</code> template (see the <a href=\"/wiki/Help:Cite_errors/Cite_error_group_refs_without_references\" title=\"Help:Cite errors/Cite error group refs without references\">help page</a>).</span></p><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-KlobucharBlackburn-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-KlobucharBlackburn_2-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-KlobucharBlackburn_2-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1333433106\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output .citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\"\\\"\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output .citation:target{background-color:rgba(0,127,255,0.133)}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-free.id-lock-free a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Lock-green.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-limited.id-lock-limited a,.mw-parser-output .id-lock-registration.id-l